  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bridgetown&apos;s Roads and Safety Improvement</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Proyecto Mejoramiento y Seguridad Vial Bridgetown</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INCLUDES: I)IMPROVEMENT OF TWO ROUTES WITH A TOTAL LENGTH OF ABOUT 7 KMS; II) TRAFFIC LIGHTS AT 9 MAJOR INTERSECTIONS; III) SIDEWALKS AND SPECIAL PEDESTRIAN ACCESSES; AND IV) AN INSTITUTIONAL STRENGHTHENING PROGRAM FOR THE MINISTRY OF TRANSPORTATION AND PUBLIC WORKS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
